    "skill-creator@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "swift-lsp@claude-plugins-official": false
  },
  "tui": "fullscreen",
  "theme": "light",
  "remoteControlAtStartup": false,
  "agentPushNotifEnabled": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "environment": [
      "$defaults",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development, mostly Viam robotics modules and personal tooling",
      "**Source control** (extends the default): repos named in the session repo's CLAUDE.md are inside the trust boundary alongside the session's repo; public ones are still public for publication rules",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: `gh` (GitHub), `viam` (Viam CLI for modules, machine config, and fleet management)",
      "**Trusted internal domains** (replaces the default): `*.viam.com` (Viam app, API, and Go SDK) and `*.viam.cloud` (the user's Viam machines)"
    ],
    "allow": [
      "$defaults",
      "Project Issue Work: Working with GitHub issues in the session's repo, or in a repo named in the session repo's CLAUDE.md, is routine project work, not an External System Write. Covers creating issues; commenting on them; editing their title, body, labels, assignees, and milestone; closing and reopening them; closing keywords (e.g. `Closes #N`) for those issues in commits and PRs; and adding or updating those issues as items on the owner's GitHub Projects. Does not cover deleting or transferring issues, locking conversations, or editing or deleting comments written by other people."
    ]
  }
}
